{"id":66670,"date":"2025-09-27T18:20:22","date_gmt":"2025-09-27T17:20:22","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=66670"},"modified":"2026-09-04T00:10:55","modified_gmt":"2026-09-03T23:10:55","slug":"2-leguas-da-eurocidade","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/2-leguas-da-eurocidade\/","title":{"rendered":"2 L\u00e9guas da Eurocidade 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">2 L\u00e9guas da Eurocidade 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">As <strong>2 L\u00e9guas da Eurocidade 2026<\/strong> celebram a uni\u00e3o desportiva e cultural transfronteiri\u00e7a entre <strong>Valen\u00e7a<\/strong> e <strong>Tui<\/strong>, numa organiza\u00e7\u00e3o exemplar da <strong>Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Desportiva Verdoejense<\/strong> com o apoio do <strong>Munic\u00edpio de Valen\u00e7a<\/strong>. Com partida e chegada fixadas na emblem\u00e1tica <strong>Avenida da Juventude<\/strong> em Valen\u00e7a, este evento \u00edmpar convida-te a correr ou caminhar entre dois pa\u00edses, atravessando a hist\u00f3rica <strong>Ponte Internacional sobre o Rio Minho<\/strong> que liga o Alto Minho portugu\u00eas \u00e0 Galiza espanhola.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">O programa principal destaca a veloz prova das <strong>2 L\u00e9guas (10 km)<\/strong>, de tra\u00e7ado maioritariamente plano e cronometragem eletr\u00f3nica por chip a cargo da <strong>Cyclones Sports<\/strong>, integrando ainda a <strong>Caminhada de 5 km<\/strong> de cariz de lazer e as provas jovens gratuitas <strong>Mini-L\u00e9gua (1,5 km)<\/strong> e <strong>L\u00e9guazinha (500 m)<\/strong>. O evento conta com abastecimentos l\u00edquidos a meio do percurso e na meta, balne\u00e1rios com duches quentes no Pavilh\u00e3o Municipal de Valen\u00e7a, trof\u00e9us aos tr\u00eas primeiros classificados da geral e escal\u00f5es et\u00e1rios, bem como lembran\u00e7as e medalhas de participa\u00e7\u00e3o para todos os atletas.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data &#038; Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">25 de Outubro de 2026 \u00e0s 09:30<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho &#038; Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Avenida da Juventude, Valen\u00e7a, Viana do Castelo<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Dist\u00e2ncias<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">10 km, 5 km (Caminhada), 1.5 km e 500 m<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: upperc